DESCRIPTION:Join the Maurer Career Services Office on Thursday\, Septembe
 r 10 from 5:00-7:00 for the 2026 Career Expo.  Designed for first-year la
 w students\, the Career Expo provides an opportunity to connect with atto
 rneys and legal employers from a variety of practice settings. Students c
 an learn about different practice areas and organizations\, ask questions
  about legal careers\, and begin building professional relationships earl
 y in their law school experience.  Additional event details\, including t
 he schedule and participating employers\, will be shared as they become a
 vailable.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Join the Maurer Career Services Office 
 on Thursday\, September 10 from 5:00-7:00 for the 2026 Career Expo.</p><p
 >  Designed for first-year law students\, the Career Expo provides an opp
 ortunity to connect with attorneys and legal employers from a variety of 
 practice settings. Students can learn about different practice areas and 
 organizations\, ask questions about legal careers\, and begin building pr
 ofessional relationships early in their law school experience.</p><p>  Ad
 ditional event details\, including the schedule and participating employe
 rs\, will be shared as they become available.<br /><br /></p>
